      {
        "id": 143808,
        "name": "arenson9",
        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-03T01:00:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Don't have the wording in front of me. Don't they each say \"If X ... instead you may do Y ..\"?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If so, I'd think that you can choose to use one of the card's powers or the other, but not both. Even if you could use both, I don't see why you could use them each more than once.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:21:17.853Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
