        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Don&#39;t have the wording in front of me. Don&#39;t they each say &quot;If X ... instead you may do Y ..&quot;?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If so, I&#39;d think that you can choose to use one of the card&#39;s powers or the other, but not both. Even if you could use both, I don&#39;t see why you could use them each more than once.</p>",
