      {
        "id": 143809,
        "name": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "username": "lutherbellhendricksv",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lutherbellhendricksv/{size}/2350_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-07T18:08:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38\" title=\"\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38_2_391x500.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"t7MxbWcHGziOElVfGLSiMjE3Q5G\" width=\"391\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38_2_391x500.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38_2_586x750.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38_2_782x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cc20444fd28872197ca1e066042894e76246ce38_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">2055×2623 679 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you have both Defensive Sacrifice and Shared Burden equipped, and Proletariat would take 2 or more damage, both replacement effects want to be applied. Proletariat chooses which one to apply first. Then, since whichever one you chose has reduced the damage below 2, the other one no longer applies.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>End result – for each attack of 2 or more damage, you get to use one of the powers, but not both.</p>",
